/* Settings footnotes */
"Each space shows its index plus a glyph per window." = "Each space shows its index plus a glyph per window.";
"Distance from the left edge of the menu bar row. Vertical Offset in Appearance moves the strip up or down." = "Distance from the left edge of the menu bar row. Vertical Offset in Appearance moves the strip up or down.";
"Gap between the strip and the edge of the notch area." = "Gap between the strip and the edge of the notch area.";
"Floating spaces are marked f, stack spaces s, bsp spaces unmarked." = "Floating spaces are marked f, stack spaces s, bsp spaces unmarked.";
"App Font draws sketchybar-app-font glyphs. Native Icons draws each app's own icon, falling back to the app-font glyph then initials when unavailable." = "App Font draws sketchybar-app-font glyphs. Native Icons draws each app's own icon, falling back to the app-font glyph then initials when unavailable.";
"When on, an app with several windows on one space shows a single glyph." = "When on, an app with several windows on one space shows a single glyph.";
"Draws a | between spaces that sit on different displays." = "Draws a | between spaces that sit on different displays.";
"Extra windows on a space collapse into a +N indicator once this cap is reached." = "Extra windows on a space collapse into a +N indicator once this cap is reached.";
"Glyphs, fills and the glass edge resolve against this theme. Follow main HUD uses the theme from the Appearance pane." = "Glyphs, fills and the glass edge resolve against this theme. Follow main HUD uses the theme from the Appearance pane.";
"Icon Spacing is the extra gap between two app icons. Index Padding is the gap between a space's number and its first icon." = "Icon Spacing is the extra gap between two app icons. Index Padding is the gap between a space's number and its first icon.";
"Positive moves the strip down, into the screen interior. 0 is centered. Negative moves it up toward the top edge." = "Positive moves the strip down, into the screen interior. 0 is centered. Negative moves it up toward the top edge.";
"Clear matches the left of the native Liquid Glass slider, Opaque the right, and Tinted adds the theme colour." = "Clear matches the left of the native Liquid Glass slider, Opaque the right, and Tinted adds the theme colour.";
"None draws no background shape. Pill is fully rounded ends, Rounded Rectangle uses the corner radius below, Bar is square ends." = "None draws no background shape. Pill is fully rounded ends, Rounded Rectangle uses the corner radius below, Bar is square ends.";
"Hairline outline around the strip, independent of the material. With none it outlines the plain strip bounds." = "Hairline outline around the strip, independent of the material. With none it outlines the plain strip bounds.";
"The highlight is the hovered segment's glyph box grown by Hover Padding on both axes, not the height of the menu bar, and hover only arms within it." = "The highlight is the hovered segment's glyph box grown by Hover Padding on both axes, not the height of the menu bar, and hover only arms within it.";
